{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541890/extras/67d9f9a487e066626ed636900332dcef.avif?t=1771557280\" width=250 height=67 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Modern Ghost-Hunting Experience</strong> <br>Abnormality is a realistic multiplayer ghost-hunting horror game built in Unreal Engine 5, focused on immersion, tension, and realism.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Independent Norwegian Development</strong> <br>Developed by the Norwegian indie studio Nightmare Studios, which involves a solo developer, with a strong focus on atmosphere, detail, and long-term support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541890/extras/3f73c43a738614b68be42545f3663904.avif?t=1771557280\" width=250 height=67 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Immersive Graphics</strong> <br>Deep immersion with minimal UI and no traditional HUD, keeping your focus on the environment and your equipment.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Ghost-Hunting Tools</strong><br>Use familiar paranormal investigation equipment inspired by real-world ghost hunting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intelligent Ghosts</strong><br>Ghosts react to player behavior, investigation progress, and environmental changes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Recognition</strong><br>Speak naturally through your microphone and the ghost may hear you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Urban Exploration</strong><br>You play as an urban explorer entering abandoned locations you are not meant to access.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong><br>Every location contains hidden lore explaining why a ghost exists there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Locations</strong><br>Investigate a variety of maps including houses, a carnival, sewers, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exorcism Mode</strong><br>A separate game mode focused on confronting the entity directly, planned for release in 2026.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541890/extras/60ab84dd6bea9368cd34eae4a465bb2c.avif?t=1771557280\" width=250 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total Darkness</strong><br>Locations are completely pitch black with no power or working lights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abandoned and Restricted Areas</strong><br>All locations are off-limits, decayed, and unsafe to enter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forced Entry</strong><br>Break through wooden planks, crawl under police tape, and squeeze through tight spaces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Intensity Horror</strong><br>Horror is a core focus, featuring jumpscares, dramatic hunts, and escalating danger.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541890/extras/aa233db6f034fc82075c09aa77aa9210.avif?t=1771557280\" width=250 height=67 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-Op Focused Gameplay</strong><br>Designed to be played together with up to 4 players.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proximity Voice Chat</strong><br>Communicate naturally with your team, but be careful what you say and when you say it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shared Investigation</strong><br>Work together to gather evidence, identify the ghost, and survive the encounter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541890/extras/f9cc8119ef839c6935253165b5e5df53.avif?t=1771557280\" width=250 height=67 /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Player Customization</strong><br>Customize height, weight, face structure, skin tone, clothing, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be Yourself</strong><br>Designed to make your character closely resemble you and feel personal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanding Customization</strong><br>Lobby customization and equipment customization are coming in future updates.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Show Me The Way","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2541890/4138d10f5701601a8fdce5ab89ee52e46dc8857b.jpg"},{"name":"The Power Compels You","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2541890/391d64337dc200cdba6e714132c4f215d1374db1.jpg"},{"name":"Joining The Other Side","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2541890/7df89e8d4bd3aaf9699b3d8624429f1b1d4adc15.jpg"},{"name":"Must Be A Speedrun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2541890/57da47b301e8cb264a2dc9592ebbd39bd2bfa1a9.jpg"},{"name":"Ghost Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2541890/1356851bce79b40ead7323169791b011538b9a32.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Run","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2541890/b53eec4b9373cd26cde2156c81d2348859cf8b68.jpg"},{"name":"In Too Deep","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic